  /Alt (This hierarchical overview diagram presents the Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) High Resolution Layers (HRL) vegetated land cover characteristics product portfolio. The top-level category, labelled 'High Resoluton Layers vegetated land cover characteristics' (note: 'Resolution' is misspelled as 'Resoluton' in the image), branches into three distinct product groups: 1. **Tree Cover & Forest Products:** These products have been available yearly since 2018. 2. **Grasslands Products:** These products have been available yearly since 2017. 3. **Cropland Products:** These products have been available yearly since 2017. The diagram indicates the start year for the yearly availability of each product category within the HRL vegetated land cover characteristics.)
